{"name":"Meissen Blue","hex":"#007fb9","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"blue","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a blue hue.","Depressed, melancholic, sad."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The colour of the clear sky or the deep sea; the colour midway between green and violet in the visible spectrum and one of the primary additive colours.","Anything coloured blue, especially to distinguish it from similar objects differing only in colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blue"}],"entries":[{"title":"Meissen","blocks":[{"text":"Meissen is a town of approximately 30,000 inhabitants, situated about 25 km (16 mi) north‑west of Dresden and 75 km (47 mi) west of Bautzen, on both banks of the River Elbe in the Free State of Saxony, in eastern Germany. Meissen is renowned as the home of Meissen porcelain, the Albrechtsburg castle, the Gothic Meissen Cathedral, and the Meissen Church of Our Lady. The town of Meissen, designated as a Große Kreisstadt, serves as the administrative seat of the Meissen district."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/Meissen_-_Albrechtsburg_und_Dom_-_2017.jpg/330px-Meissen_-_Albrechtsburg_und_Dom_-_2017.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meissen","wikidata":"Q8738"},{"title":"Blue","blocks":[{"text":"Blue is one of the three primary colours in the RGB (additive) colour model, as well as in the RYB colour model. It lies between violet and cyan on the spectrum of visible light. The term blue generally describes colours perceived by humans observing light with a dominant wavelength between approximately 450 and 495 nanometres. The clear daytime sky and the deep sea appear blue because of an optical effect known as Rayleigh scattering. An optical effect called the Tyndall effect explains blue eyes. Distant objects appear more blue because of another optical effect called aerial perspective."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Earth-in-true-color-himawari-09.jpg/330px-Earth-in-true-color-himawari-09.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue","wikidata":"Q1088"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/20050116500DR_Mei%C3%9Fen_Schlo%C3%9F_Siebeneichen.jpg/500px-20050116500DR_Mei%C3%9Fen_Schlo%C3%9F_Siebeneichen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/20050116500DR_Mei%C3%9Fen_Schlo%C3%9F_Siebeneichen.jpg/1280px-20050116500DR_Mei%C3%9Fen_Schlo%C3%9F_Siebeneichen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/20050116500DR_Mei%C3%9Fen_Schlo%C3%9F_Siebeneichen.jpg/500px-20050116500DR_Mei%C3%9Fen_Schlo%C3%9F_Siebeneichen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A20050116500DR_Mei%C3%9Fen_Schlo%C3%9F_Siebeneichen.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/M%C3%AD%C5%A1e%C5%88%2C_n%C3%A1m%C4%9Bst%C3%AD.jpg/500px-M%C3%AD%C5%A1e%C5%88%2C_n%C3%A1m%C4%9Bst%C3%AD.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/M%C3%AD%C5%A1e%C5%88%2C_n%C3%A1m%C4%9Bst%C3%AD.jpg/1280px-M%C3%AD%C5%A1e%C5%88%2C_n%C3%A1m%C4%9Bst%C3%AD.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/M%C3%AD%C5%A1e%C5%88%2C_n%C3%A1m%C4%9Bst%C3%AD.jpg/500px-M%C3%AD%C5%A1e%C5%88%2C_n%C3%A1m%C4%9Bst%C3%AD.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AM%C3%AD%C5%A1e%C5%88%2C_n%C3%A1m%C4%9Bst%C3%AD.j